<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <style>
        .box{
            background-color: aquamarine;
            padding: 10px;;
        }
        .box-container{
            
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(12,1fr);
            gap: 5px;
            
        }
        .first{
            background-color: rgb(155, 155, 240);
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            grid-column: span 12;
            
        }
        .col-2{
            background-color: rgb(59, 128, 189);
            grid-column: span 8;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 10px;
           
        }
       .col-3{
        background-color: rgb(59, 128, 189);
            grid-column: span 4;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 10px;
           
        }
        .col-4{
            grid-column: span 4;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .col-5{
            grid-column: span 4;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .col-6{
            grid-column: span 4;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        button{
            border-radius: 10px;
            background-color: aquamarine;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box-container">

    <div class="box first">
        <button>Featured</button><br>
       <span style="font-size: 50px;">Annual hackathon </span><br>
       <span>Teams from every semester.</span>
    </div>


    <div class="box col-2">
        <button>Spotlight</button>
        <b><pre style="color: aliceblue;font-size: large;">How Students Build a smart attendance tool</pre><br>
        <pre style="margin-top: -25px;color: rgba(247, 243, 243, 0.7);">A portal with the linkage to databse to store it on the
server for updation</pre></b>
    </div>
    <div class="box col-3"> <button>Notice</button></div>


    <div class="box col-4">GIT HUB</div>
    <div class="box col-5">UI</div>
    <div class="box col-6">Open Source Club</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
